"t": "Scriba M, Balde I, Aclavio P, Jonas E, Chinnery G. Peptic ulcer disease-related gastric outlet obstruction – does surgery still play a role? S Afr J Surg 2025;63(1):56–61. doi:10.36303/SAJS.00672",
"u": "https://doi.org/10.36303/SAJS.00672"
